export const levels = {zh:{lower:'初小 · 小一至小三',upper:'高小 · 小四至小六',junior:'初中 · 中一至中三',senior:'高中 · 中四至中六'},en:{lower:'Lower primary · P1–P3',upper:'Upper primary · P4–P6',junior:'Junior secondary · S1–S3',senior:'Senior secondary · S4–S6'}};
export function allocate(total,count=5){const a=Array(count).fill(1);for(let i=0;i<total-count;i++)a[[1,2,2,3,0][i%5]%count]++;return a;}
export function samplePlan(d,lang='zh'){
 const en=lang==='en',s=strategies.find(x=>x.id===d.strategy)||strategies[0],x=s[lang],young=d.level==='lower',senior=d.level==='senior';
 const age=en?(young?'Accept a drawing or one short sentence; model an example.':senior?'Compare evidence, assumptions and counterexamples.':'Prepare one idea and one supporting reason.'):(young?'可接受畫圖或短句；教師先示範。':senior?'比較依據、假設及反例。':'準備一個想法及一個支持想法的理由。');
 const topic=d.topic||(en?'the current lesson topic':'這一課的內容'),group=en?(d.constraints.includes('seats')?'Work with a nearby partner without moving seats.':'Form pairs or small groups; include an odd pupil in a trio.'):(d.constraints.includes('seats')?'與鄰座配對，不移動座位。':'按課室空間配對或組成小組；人數為單數時安排三人一組。');
 const frame=en?'“My idea is … because …”; “What supports that?”':'「我覺得……，因為……」「有咩例子支持你嘅諗法？」';
 const stages=en?(s.id==='joint'?['Set a shared outcome','Prepare one contribution each','Combine contributions','Explain the shared answer','Reflect on participation']:s.id==='reason'?['Model an explanation','Prepare an idea and reason','Question and respond','Compare explanations','Revise and reflect']:['Set one shared question','Think independently','Share in turns','Bring ideas together','Check and close']):(s.id==='joint'?['設定共同成果','每人準備一個想法','整理各人的想法','解釋答案怎樣形成','回顧參與情況']:s.id==='reason'?['示範怎樣解釋','準備想法與理由','追問與回應','比較不同解釋','修訂與回顧']:['提出共同問題','每人先準備','輪流分享與聆聽','整理不同觀點','檢視與收結']);
 const texts=en?[`Ask an open question about ${topic}. ${age}`,`Ask each pupil to prepare an idea independently. Goal: ${d.goal}`,`${group} Each person contributes before a shared answer is agreed. ${d.constraints.includes('support')?frame:age}`,'Invite different answers and a follow-up question. Record uncertainty as well as agreement.','Ask what changed in pupils’ thinking. Note participation and the reasons pupils offered.']:[`圍繞「${topic}」提出開放問題。${age}`,`每位學生先獨立準備一個想法。目標：${d.goal}`,`${group} 每人先提出一個想法，再整理共同答案。${d.constraints.includes('support')?frame:age}`,'邀請不同答案與追問，保留不同意見與不確定之處。','請學生記下想法有何改變；教師觀察參與方式及學生提出的理由。'];
 return {learningRationale:en?'This fixed sample offers preparation, explanation and an individual check. Check whether it fits your subject goal; it is not a topic-specific AI design.':'這份固定示範安排個人準備、解釋及獨立檢查。請核對是否配合你的學科目標；這不是按課題生成的 AI 活動。',prerequisiteCheck:en?'In the opening stage, ask pupils to recall one relevant idea from the existing lesson materials. Model it again if needed.':'在開首步驟，請學生從原有教材說出一項相關知識；如未掌握，先作簡短示範。',evaluation:en?{lookFor:'Check whether each response addresses your stated goal and includes a relevant reason or example, rather than just counting speakers.',recordHow:'In the final stage, collect one brief response from each pupil. Mark independently explained / prompted / not yet clear; revisit any ambiguous response.',continueWhen:'Consider repeating if individual responses address the goal with less prompting and the routine is feasible. Check again in a later lesson.',adjustWhen:'If pupils have ideas but cannot express them, model one example and offer a sentence frame; if time is tight, reduce the sharing rounds.',tryDifferentWhen:'If repeated checks after support still show the same misconception, reteach the prerequisite idea or try another representation. Confirm the difficulty before changing.'}:{lookFor:'對照你填寫的目標，留意個別學生是否能提出相關理由或例子，而不只是有沒有發言。',recordHow:'在最後一步收取每人一份簡短回應，按「獨立解釋／提示後完成／仍未清楚」作簡記；不確定的回應再作追問。',continueWhen:'如個別回應能對應目標、所需提示減少，而且時間安排可行，可在下一課再試並核對。',adjustWhen:'如學生有想法但難以表達，先示範一個例子並提供句式；若時間不足，可減少分享輪次。',tryDifferentWhen:'在提供支援並再次檢查後，如仍出現相同誤解，可重教先備概念或改用另一種表達方式；先確認困難所在。'},title:`${x.name}${d.topic?' | '+d.topic:''}`,goal:d.goal,teacherPrompts:en?`What is your idea about ${topic}? What example supports it?\n${frame}`:`你對「${topic}」有咩諗法？有咩例子支持你？\n${frame}`,studentTask:en?`Prepare one idea about ${topic} and a supporting example. Share in turns with a partner, then write one sentence explaining your view.`:`先為「${topic}」準備一個想法及例子，與同學輪流分享，再用一句說話寫出自己的看法和理由。`,exitCheck:en?'Ask each pupil to write one idea and its reason before leaving. Check who needs more prompting.':'請每位同學寫下一個想法及理由，留意誰仍需要提示。',steps:stages.map((title,i)=>({title,text:texts[i],minutes:allocate(d.minutes)[i]})),materials:en?(d.constraints.includes('no-tech')?'Existing materials, paper and pencils; no electronic devices.':'Existing lesson materials and brief notes; a shared display is optional.'):(d.constraints.includes('no-tech')?'原有教材及紙筆，不使用電子裝置。':'原有教材及簡短筆記，可選用共用畫面。'),support:age,teacherNote:'',observations:en?['Did pupils prepare or contribute their own ideas?','Did they explain or respond to peers?','Which step needed more support or time?']:['學生是否準備或提出自己的想法？','學生是否解釋理由或回應同學？','哪個步驟需要更多支援或時間？'],evidence:[{sourceId:s.source,finding:sources.find(a=>a.id===s.source)[lang].finding,application:x.description+' '+age,limitation:sources.find(a=>a.id===s.source)[lang].limit}],sources,origin:'template',language:lang};
}
